-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("es",355,{
[11329]="7004E490\n1\tDefeat and collect harnessed stone-biters in the Ironfold (total: 8)\tHarnessed stone-biters can be found along the Emyn Engrin in the Ironfold. Foreman Brumbur has asked you to defeat and collect harnessed stone-biters that have inadvertently burrowed out of Járnfast.\n2\tDeliver the harnessed stone-biters to Foreman Brumbur in Járnfast\tForeman Brumbur can be found among the ruined mines of Járnfast. You have collected a number of harnessed stone-biters in the Ironfold and should deliver them to Foreman Brumbur in Járnfast.\n",
[11330]="70062140\n1\tRecupera las provisiones robadas (total: 10)\tBurl Siempreviva te ha pedido que recuperes provisiones robadas de los orcos de Tharbad. Tharbad está en el sur de Cardolan.\n2\tVuelve con Burl Siempreviva\tDeberías llevar las provisiones recuperadas a Burl Siempreviva. Burl se encuentra cerca de Tharbad, en el sur de Cardolan.\n",
[11331]="7005AAB2\n1\tCollect samples from exposed crystals in the Pit of Stonejaws (total: 6)\tExposed crystals can be found throughout the Pit of Stonejaws. You should hit exposed crystals with Fúni's pick and collect the crystal samples that break off.\n2\tTalk to Fúni Gem-cutter\tYou have collected samples of the crystals found in the Pit of Stonejaws. You should return to Fúni Gem-cutter in Bárgstad.\n",
[11332]="7005A744\n1\tDefeat Anioch\030Defeat Krigash\tDefeat Anioch or Krigash.\n2\tHabla con Zádokh Ojo de Sílex\tYou should return to Zádokh Flint-eye and apprise him of your efforts.\n",
[11333]="7005A742\n1\tDefeat Angmarim (total: 15)\030Derrota a los hobotrasgos (total: 15)\tDefeat Angmarim or hobgoblins.\n",
[11334]="7005A73E\n1\tCollect moon-letters (total: 10)\tCollect moon-letters.\n",
[11335]="7000EC0E\n1\tConsigue piedras de la bahía (total: 4)\tLas piedras que Kaleva necesita se pueden encontrar en la bahía de hielo, al este de Sûri-kylä, cerca de la orilla. Kaleva te ha pedido que consigas algunas rocas para la sauna.\n2\tUsa Mound\030Recoge Bay-stone\tLa sauna de los Lossoth está en Sûri-kylä, al noreste de la bahía de hielo de Forochel. Kaleva te ha indicado que coloques las piedras de la bahía en montículos cerca del fuego, junto a la sauna Lossoth.\n3\tHabla con Kaleva\tKaleva está en Sûri-kylä. Ahora que has colocado las piedras, deberías hablar con Kaleva.\n",
[11336]="700088B8\n1\tReturn to Soldier Fandmau at Tírith Rhaw\030Recoge fragmentos de piedra de troll (total: 5)\030Collect shards of troll-stone (total: 5)\030Recoge los fragmentos de piedra de troll (total: 2)\tTrolls that have been turned to stone by the sun are scattered throughout the Ettenmoors. Soldier Fandmau tasked you with obtaining a fair number of large to small bits of troll-stone to repair the walls of Tírith Rhaw.\n",
[11337]="70020DB8\n1\tRecolecta carne de ciervo (total: 10)\tLos ciervos blancos se pueden encontrar deambulando por los Valles Sombríos de Enedwaith. Caradog Henbuch te ha pedido que caces ciervos blancos y le lleves la carne.\n2\tHabla con Caradog Henbuch en Maur Tulhau\tCaradog Henbuch se encuentra en Maur Tulhau, en los Valles Sombríos de Enedwaith. Llévale a Caradog Henbuch la carne que has recolectado.\n",
[11338]="70020DBF\n1\tRecolecta carne de ciervo (total: 10)\030Recolecta astas de ciervo (total: 10)\tSe pueden encontrar ciervos blancos en los Valles Sombríos. Caradog Henbuch te ha pedido que recolectes más carne de ciervo para él y astas para Rhosun Turio.\n2\tHabla con Caradog Henbuch en Maur Tulhau\tCaradog Henbuch se encuentra en Maur Tulhau, en los Valles Sombríos de Enedwaith. Debes llevarle a Caradog Henbuch la carne y las astas que has recolectado.\n",
[11339]="7003720D\n1\tFind evidence of the evil things Herehasen spoke of\tHerehasen believes that there are strange and evil things dwelling beneath the eaves of Fangorn, north of Tordag's camp. Herehasen wants you to hunt for the evils which dwell in Fangorn and bring proof of their existence so that the people of Torsbury will see that he is not mad.\n2\tTalk to Blackthorn the Ent in Fangorn\tBlackthorn the Ent dwells in Fangorn, north of Torsbury. You should speak with Blackthorn the Ent and learn what brings him to the eaves of Fangorn.\n",
[11340]="7006C53E\n1\tDerrota a los boticarios de Urâshi (total: 6)\030Destruye los suministros de los boticarios (total: 6)\tTu misión es viajar a Zikrum-dûl para derrotar a los boticarios y su líder, así como destruir sus estaciones de trabajo.\n2\tEncuentra y derrota a Samûku\tEncuentra y derrota a Samûku en Zikrum-dûl.\n",
[11341]="70001817\n1\tDerrota a los exploradores Duramano (total: 5)\tHay exploradores Duramano dispersos por la zona al norte de Othrikar. Para reducir la amenaza de que los Duramano se conviertan en algo más que una molestia, Hannar te ha pedido que pongas fin al espionaje sin restricciones de los exploradores Duramano.\n2\tRegresa a Hannar\tHannar está en Othrikar. Deberías regresar con Hannar.\n",
[11342]="7001E7EE\n1\tDerrota a Orthadban\tOrthadban se encuentra en la parte más alta de Sâd Doldúr, al sur de Barad Angol. Faerchiril te ha pedido que derrotes al malvado hechicero Orthadban.\n2\tHabla con Faerchiril en Barad Angol\tFaerchiril está en Barad Angol, al norte de Sâd Doldúr. Debes hablar con Faerchiril y contarle historias de tu victoria.\n",
[11343]="700597FC\n1\tInvoca y derrota a la Encina Malvada\tLa Encina Malvada puede ser invocada quemando la corteza sombría en la cima de una colina en el suroeste del Bosque Salvaje. Mantoespino te ha pedido que derrotes a la Encina Malvada.\n2\tRegresa con Mantoespino\tMantoespino está en el sur del Bosque Salvaje. Deberías hablar con Mantoespino.\n",
[11344]="70008077\n1\tDestruye partes de máquinas de asedio (total: 6)\tEstán montando las partes de armas de asedio en el campamento orco del norte de Fornost. Deberías destruir las partes de las armas de asedio que los orcos Blogmal están montando.\n2\tInforma a Gareth Cope de las armas de asedio que has destruido.\tGareth Cope está en el campamento de los Pueblos Libres en las afueras, en el extremo sur de Fornost. Deberías volver junto a Gareth Cope para informarle de que has destruido un buen número de partes de armas de asedio.\n",
[11345]="7006215E\n1\tHabla con Maeriel\tMerruth te ha pedido que hables con su hermana, Maeriel, para ver qué se puede hacer con los huargos enfermos. Maeriel está en la Pradera de Juncos, en Cardolan.\n2\tAcaba con huargos enfermos (total: 8)\tLa hermana de Merruth, Maeriel, te ha dicho que acabes con huargos enfermos antes de que se propague la enfermedad. Los huargos enfermos pueden encontrarse en la Pradera de Juncos.\n3\tHabla con Maeriel\tDeberías decirle a MAeriel que has acabado con muchos huargos enfermos. Maeriel está en la Pradera de Juncos, en Cardolan.\n",
[11346]="70052B26\n1\tCollect meat from boars at Málvang (total: 20)\tBoars can be found at Málvang in southern Woodsedge. Madelgard has asked you to hunt boars at Málvang and gather meat for the Woodmen of Hultvís.\n2\tDeliver the cuts of boar meat to Madelgard\tMadelgard can be found in Hultvís. You have gathered many cuts of meat from the boars at Málvang and should now deliver them to Madelgard.\n",
[11347]="7003FFF3\n1\tRecupera suministros (total: 6)\tThe supplies must be recovered.\n",
[11348]="70025C04\n1\tAyuda a Clark Cercapiedra\030Ayuda a Ballard Wilmer\030Ayuda a Rowena Guardacotos\030Ayuda a Poppy Silleras\tVarios de los habitantes de Ost Forod tienen trabajo que debe hacerse antes de que llegue el invierno. Basilio Resinas te dijo que antes de hacer lo que los Montaraces quieren, primero deben atenderse varias de las necesidades del pueblo.\n2\tHabla con Basilio Resinas en Ost Forod\tBasilio Resinas está en Ost Forod. Basilio Resinas se alegrará de saber que Ost Forod está abastecido y preparado para un largo invierno.\n",
[11349]="70052359\n1\tTalk to Thenca atop Helm's Dike\tThenca stands atop Helm's Dike, awaiting your attention.\n2\tPick up one of the ballista bolts near Thenca\tThenca, one of the Rohirrim defenders of Helm's Dike, has asked for your help carrying bolts to the forward ballista.\n3\tTalk to Cenric at the forward ballista\tCenric accepted the bolts you and Thenca brought to the forward ballista, but he wears a worried expression, and his face is lined with fear.\n4\tFight alongside Cenric at Helm's Dike\tSaruman's Orcs have advanced upon the eastern side of Helm's Dike, and you must stand against them with Cenric, Thenca, and Gamling.\n5\tHabla con Gamling\tGamling has called for you at the eastern side of Helm's Dike.\n6\tFollow Gamling to the far side of the Dike\tGamling has called for your assistance as he hurries to the far side of the Dike, there to combat Saruman's forces before they can crush the Rohirrim defenders.\n7\tTalk to Thenca at Helm's Dike\tAs you hurry between the defensive encampments at Helm's Dike alongside Gamling and other soldiers of Rohan, you have spotted the great war machine with which Saruman's forces hope to destroy the gate.\n8\tFight alongside Thenca at Helm's Dike\tSaruman's Orcs have advanced upon the western side of Helm's Dike, and you must stand against them with Cenric, Thenca, and Gamling.\n9\tTalk to Gamling on the western side of Helm's Dike\tAs the soldiers of Rohan fight the invading Orcs on the western side of the Dike, Gamling has called you to him.\n10\tFollow the soldiers of Rohan to the gate in Helm's Dike\tGamling has ordered you and the other soldiers of Rohan to fall back from the defence of Helm's Dike.\n11\tTalk to Cenric by the stable at Helm's Dike\tCenric has stopped by the stables, despite the imminent arrival of Saruman's armies.\n12\tUntie horses stabled at Helm's Dike (total: 3)\tCenric despairs that the steeds of the Rohirrim stabled at Helm's Dike will be slain by the invading Orcs, and he seeks your help untying the proud creatures so they may fight back against the aggressors.\n13\tTalk to Thenca by the stables near Helm's Dike\tThenca is pleased you took the time to free the horses stabled at Helm's Dike, for the Orcs will soon be upon them.\n",
[11350]="7005235B\n1\tHabla con Legolas en lo alto del Muro del Bajo\tLegolas stands atop the Deeping Wall, ready for battle.\n2\tPatrol the wall and defeat Orcs as they climb up and attack\030Push ladders away from the wall\tOrcs climb up the ladders leaning against the Deeping Wall and must be defeated. Legolas also asked you to push down as many of the ladders as you can.\n3\tDrop the readied stones from the west trap\tEgláf has loaded the western rock trap on the Deeping Wall and waits for you to set it off.\n4\tPatrol the wall and defeat Orcs as they climb up and attack\030Push ladders away from the wall\tOrcs continue to climb up the ladders leaning against the Deeping Wall and must be defeated. You should continue to knock down their ladders, slowing their progress.\n5\tDrop the readied stones from the remaining traps\tTwo more rock traps have been loaded atop the Deeping Wall, and Egláf waits for you to release their deadly contents onto the Orcs below.\n6\tTalk to Egláf by the rock trap on the Deeping Wall\tEgláf has called for you to come to his aid.\n7\tDefend Egláf from the Orcs\tOrcs have gained access to one of the towers and dealt Egláf a grievous blow. Protect him from their weapons!\n8\tHabla con Egláf\tThe surprise Orc attack knocked Egláf down, but he has recovered from the surprise and wishes to speak to you.\n9\tDefeat the Orcs on top of the tower above the Deeping Wall\tOrcs have climbed onto the top of the tower, and Egláf has sent you to clear them away.\n10\tTalk to Thenca atop the tower above the Deeping Wall\tThenca has followed you onto the top of the tower above the Deeping Wall.\n11\tDefend Thenca and keep him alive\tThere seems to be no end to Saruman's Orcs, but Thenca has sworn to defend the Deeping Wall and will do so with his life, if that proves necessary.\n",
[11351]="7005235C\n1\tHabla con Aragorn en el valle del Bajo.\tAragorn ha regresado de su salida con Éomer, y ahora tiene una tarea urgente para ti.\n2\tDerrota a las fuerzas de Saruman dentro del valle del Bajo (total: 10)\030Apaga las mechas encendidas en el valle del Bajo (total: 4)\tAragorn te ha pedido que derrotes a los orcos y a los Dunlendinos que han pasado por el agujero en el Muro del Bajo y que amenazan a los Rohirrim dentro del valle del Bajo. También quiere que apagues las mechas encendidas de cualquier dispositivo de pólvora negra que encuentres.\n3\tApaga más dispositivos con pólvora negra cerca del agujero en el Muro del Bajo ([según el diario]/4)\t¡Los orcos han colocado más dispositivos con pólvora negra cerca del agujero en el Muro del Bajo, y las mechas están a punto de llegar al final de sus cortas y peligrosas vidas!\n4\tAyuda a Egláf a ponerse de pie\tEgláf necesita tu ayuda para retirarse más hacia el valle del Bajo.\n5\tHabla con Léofdag en el Valle del Bajo\tLéofdag y el resto de los Cuatro Jinetes se alegran de luchar a tu lado para defender su tierra, y juntos esperan repeler las fuerzas de Saruman.\n6\tHabla con Burnoth en el Valle del Bajo\tHas luchado valientemente contra las fuerzas de Saruman con los Cuatro Jinetes en el valle del Bajo, y ahora su capitán Burnoth desea hablar contigo.\n",
[11352]="7005235D\n1\tTalk to Éomer in the Glittering Caves\tÉomer has come to the Glittering Caves and his anger at Lheu Brenin's attempted attack on his people knows no bounds.\n2\tÉomer has asked you to reassure the folk sheltering within the Glittering Caves that Théoden's warriors will keep them safe.\t\n3\tReassure sheltering folk that they will be safe (3/4)\tÉomer has asked you to reassure the folk sheltering within the Glittering Caves that Théoden's warriors will keep them safe.\n4\tTalk to Ardith in the Glittering Caves\tA woman in the Glittering Caves has heard your reassurances but still has questions for you.\n5\tTalk to Léofa in the Glittering Caves\tLéofa, a child of the Westfold who helped you defeat Lheu Brenin in the Glittering Caves, wishes to speak with you.\n6\tTalk to Gimli in the Glittering Caves\tGimli is in the Glittering Caves, attempting to balance his awe at its beauty with the dangers contained within.\n7\tTalk to Éomer in the Glittering Caves\tYou and Gimli have fought a number of enterprising Orcs and found Éomer deep within the Glittering Caves, at the passage where his scouts disappeared.\n8\tDefeat spiders in the Glittering Caves (total: 10)\030Free Éomer's scouts from cocooned imprisonment (total: 4)\tSpiders have trapped some of Éomer's scouts and must be slain if the men are to be freed.\n9\tTalk to Éomer in the Glittering Caves\tÉomer is waiting to hear of your success in the Glittering Caves.\n",
[11353]="7005235E\n1\tHabla con Háma\tHáma, el guardián de la puerta de Théoden, se alza frente a Cuernavilla. Se prepara para recibir noticias de la batalla.\n2\tTalk to Théoden\tThéoden stands atop the fortress, surveying his seemingly insurmountable foes.\n3\tHabla con Aragorn\tAragorn refuses to give in to despair. He intends to defend the Hornburg even as the Orcs threaten to overrun the fortress.\n4\tQuench the fuse on the black powder bomb\tKing Théoden has slain a mighty war-troll, but the beast carried a black powder bomb with a lit fuse!\n5\tHabla con Aragorn\tThe fuse on the black powder bomb has been quenched, and the immediate danger has been avoided. Aragorn wishes to speak with you.\n6\tListen to Aragorn and Théoden and decide what can be done\tThe defenders have thrown back another of Saruman's assaults, but ten thousand Orcs remain outside the walls. Aragorn and Théoden must decide if anything can be done.\n7\tMount your travelling steed and talk to Théoden\tThéoden has asked you to join his riders on their assault from the Hornburg. Mount your travelling steed and speak to Théoden.\n8\tRide with Théoden down the causeway into the waiting Orcs\tThéoden leads a charge of his riders down the causeway into the waiting Orcs, and he has requested that you ride with him.\n",
[11354]="70057C2F\n1\tTalk to Cenric and complete 'Storied Tale: Helm's Dike'\tCenric is on the field of victory after the Battle of Helm's Deep, not far from Aragorn and Théoden.\n2\tTalk to Cenric and complete 'Storied Tale: The Deeping Wall'\tCenric is on the field of victory after the Battle of Helm's Deep, not far from Aragorn and Théoden.\n3\tTalk to Cenric and complete 'Storied Tale: The Deeping-coomb'\tCenric is on the field of victory after the Battle of Helm's Deep, not far from Aragorn and Théoden.\n4\tTalk to Cenric and complete 'Storied Tale: The Glittering Caves'\tCenric is on the field of victory after the Battle of Helm's Deep, not far from Aragorn and Théoden.\n5\tTalk to Cenric and complete 'Storied Tale: The Hornburg'\tCenric is on the field of victory after the Battle of Helm's Deep, not far from Aragorn and Théoden.\n6\tTalk to Cenric on the field of victory after the battle of Helm's Deep\tCenric is on the field of victory after the Battle of Helm's Deep, not far from Aragorn and Théoden.\n",
[11355]="7002B214\n1\tHabla con Saeradan\tSaeradan espera para hablar contigo en el sendero que asciende por Methedras.\n2\tCaptura la puerta del patio exterior\tToma el control de la puerta hacia el patio exterior de la morada de Gwyllion.\n3\tCaptura la puerta del patio interior\tCon la puerta al patio exterior bajo tu control, es hora de romper la resistencia enemiga en el patio exterior y abrirte paso hasta la puerta del patio interior y la choza de Gwyllion.\n4\tCaptura la choza de Gwyllion\tLa puerta hacia el patio interior ha sido asegurada. Ahora puede asaltarse el patio interior y la choza de Gwyllion más allá.\n5\terrota a Gwyllion y Echrud en la entrada de la choza de Gwyllion y reclama el punto de control final\tEl patio ha caído. Ahora solo queda derrotar al líder del asalto y romper el asedio. Nota: Los místicos del clan del Jabalí contrarrestarán las mejoras que Gwyllion ha puesto sobre sus siervos, pero no combatirán.\n6\tHabla con Saeradan\tHabla con Saeradan.\n",
[11356]="7002B212\n1\tCompleta «Tormenta en Methedras» en un grupo de incursión\tGwyllion, la Vieja Mujer de la Montaña, busca alzar un ejército de espíritus funestos y espectros para ayudar a Isengard contra Rohan.\n",
[11357]="7005AAB8\n1\tDefeat hobgoblins in Shakhajât (total: 15)\tShakhajât is well-defended by hobgoblins, so there will be no shortage of enemies for you to face inside.\n2\tTalk to Kyrstig\tKyrstig will want to hear how many hobgoblins you faced in Shakhajât.\n",
[11358]="70043DF5\n1\tDerrota a los guardias enemigos en Shrak Mauruk (total: 10)\tShrak Mauruk se encuentra en la parte oriental de Osgiliath. Debes derrotar a los guardias enemigos dentro de Shrak Mauruk.\n2\tHabla con Melethon\tMelethon está en los Fuertes de la Calzada. Debes hablar con Melethon.\n",
[11359]="7005AAB1\n1\tDefeat hobgoblins in Stazg Vozag (total: 12)\030Defeat the fearsome Captain Zúrthrug, about whom the whispers gather\tThe out-camp of Stazg Vozag is slightly north-east of the centre of the Pit of Stonejaws.\n2\tTalk to Klúso near Stazg Vozag\tKlúso is scouting near Stazg Vozag.\n",
[11360]="7000883F\n1\tReturn the items to Tyrant Uzulthrang\030Recoge pies de hobbit (total: 10)\030Collect legs of Men (total: 10)\030Collect Elf-ears (total: 10)\030Recoge barbas de enanos (total: 10)\tTyrant Uzulthrang told you to assemble proof of your deeds, then and only then will he assist you in destroying the fools within Tol Ascarnen. He did not, however, tell you what proof he requires.\n",
})
